    <div style="margin-top:2.5rem;">
      <p class="section-desc"><b>Difficulty breakdown</b></p>
      <p class="caption">GLM-5 maintains a consistent lead across all tiers. Nova-2-Lite collapses entirely on Hard environments.</p>
